---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Christoph Pageler">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <p class="lede">I have been writing software for over 15 years, most of it for Apple platforms. What I enjoy most is building the thing I need myself, then making it good enough for other people to use.</p>

  <div class="block">
    <h2>day job</h2>
    <p>I lead iOS development at OffBlock, where we build B2B software used every day by people who have very little patience for detours. Alongside the code I do product work and keep the team coordinated.</p>
    <div class="rows plain">
      <div><span>Swift, SwiftUI, Swift Packages</span><span class="val">daily</span></div>
      <div><span>Live Activities, widgets, Dynamic Island</span><span class="val">in production</span></div>
      <div><span>Xcode Cloud, TestFlight</span><span class="val">monthly releases</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <h2>running at home</h2>
    <p>Not products, but the reason I still like this after 15 years. Everything here runs on my own hardware and answers to nobody but me.</p>
    <div class="rows">
      <div><span class="dot"></span><span>Energy monitoring <em>— my own solar setup, my own system</em></span><span class="val">since 2024</span></div>
      <div><span class="dot"></span><span>Document management <em>— self-hosted</em></span><span class="val">Mac mini</span></div>
      <div><span class="dot"></span><span>Home automation <em>— small things I would only notice if they stopped</em></span><span class="val">ongoing</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="block">
    <h2>elsewhere</h2>
    <div class="rows plain">
      <div><span>GitHub</span><a class="val" href="https://github.com/">github.com</a></div>
      <div><span>Email</span><a class="val" href="mailto:christoph@pageler-software.de">christoph@pageler-software.de</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
